## How to use

- Read the relevant `SKILL.md` before running any of its scripts.
- Run scripts from the repo root: `python .github/skills/<name>/scripts/<script>.py --help`.
- Record every run with `python .tmp/scripts/run_store.py` (see AGENTS.md § Data flow).
- Credentials live in `.env` (never committed).
